  "protocol": "OMNI404",
  "name": "OMNI404 transfer treats small amounts as ERC-721 ids and pays a full unit per Uniswap V3 exact-output swap",
  "summary": "O404.transfer(to, valueOrId) treats values up to 50 as ERC-721 ids and, if the caller owns that id, moves a full 1e18 unit plus the NFT. The O404/WETH Uniswap V3 pool pays outputs with transfer(), so after ids were parked in the pool, exact-output swaps of id-many wei paid 1e18 O404 each for ~2 wei of WETH, and the O404 was sold back for the pool's WETH.",
