  ],
  "notes": [
    "Direct immutable OMNI404 runtime (no DELEGATECALL or SELFDESTRUCT). The owner's later writes are setWhitelist(pool) at 19195556, LayerZero setPeer calls and setBaseURI; the whitelist only stops the pool's balance from minting its own NFTs (without it the pool would hold low ids directly), so it is not necessary to the id/amount confusion.",
    "Loss is the pool's WETH depletion over the attacker's four transactions and 44 copy transactions by MEV bots and other senders within the next 63 blocks. Selection: pool Swap events whose O404 amount is below 1e12 wei (Etherscan logs from pool creation); none precede the anchor."
  ],
